* provenance: NJM4558 dual operational amplifier datasheet, New Japan Radio (JRC), https://www.njr.com/semicon/products/NJM4558.html; values typed from memory of the sheet and UNVERIFIED against the current revision
* fit: typical at +-15 V: open-loop gain 100 dB (100 V/mV), GBW 3 MHz, slew rate 1.7 V/us, output swing +-13 V at RL = 10 kOhm (2 V rail drop), input resistance 5 MOhm; output resistance 75 Ohm is a typical value, not a sheet figure
* author: 4esv
* license: MIT

* Pins: inp inn out vcc vee. Gain 100000 V/V, GBW 3E+06 Hz, slew rate 1.7E+06 V/s, rail drop 2 V.
.subckt JRC4558 inp inn out vcc vee
Rid inp inn 5E+06
Bgm 0 x I={9.01878E-05*tanh(0.001*V(inp,inn)/9.01878E-05)}
Rp x 0 1E+08
Cc x 0 5.30516E-11
Bclamp x 0 I={9.01878E-05*(V(x)-(0.5*((0.5*(V(x)+V(vee)+sqrt((V(x)-(V(vee)))*(V(x)-(V(vee)))+0.000001)))+V(vcc)-sqrt(((0.5*(V(x)+V(vee)+sqrt((V(x)-(V(vee)))*(V(x)-(V(vee)))+0.000001)))-(V(vcc)))*((0.5*(V(x)+V(vee)+sqrt((V(x)-(V(vee)))*(V(x)-(V(vee)))+0.000001)))-(V(vcc)))+0.000001))))}
Bo o 0 V={V(x)}
Rout o out 75
Bout out 0 I={100*(V(out)-(0.5*((0.5*(V(out)+V(vee)+2+sqrt((V(out)-(V(vee)+2))*(V(out)-(V(vee)+2))+0.000001)))+V(vcc)-2-sqrt(((0.5*(V(out)+V(vee)+2+sqrt((V(out)-(V(vee)+2))*(V(out)-(V(vee)+2))+0.000001)))-(V(vcc)-2))*((0.5*(V(out)+V(vee)+2+sqrt((V(out)-(V(vee)+2))*(V(out)-(V(vee)+2))+0.000001)))-(V(vcc)-2))+0.000001))))}
.ends JRC4558

